WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:15,640
This pure dog does have some skills

2
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,160
Even the large back armor can be easily cracked

3
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:29,140
It’s an excellent high-explosive trump card. Let’s play it.

4
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,700
Don't let the children get hurt

5
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,940
If you get hurt, I will pluck all your hair out.

6
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,260
What on earth have I done?

7
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,460
summoned to resuscitation

8
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,860
To actually step onto such a fire-eyed bamboo

9
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:40,780
big dog lie down

10
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,180
Let's play horse riding
